# Build context filter for hosting/Dockerfile (BuildKit: <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Keeps the context small — only frontend/ + rust/ + the served skills are copied in.
.git
.github
.agents
# R23.6: the served skills bake into the binary via include_str!, so the
# context must carry them. Re-including under an ignored parent requires
# re-including each level (a file under an excluded dir stays excluded).
!.agents/
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/anchorcore-setup/
!.agents/skills/anchorcore-search/
!.agents/skills/anchorcore-setup/SKILL.md
!.agents/skills/anchorcore-search/SKILL.md
.claude
agent
docs
website
sample
scripts
build
dist
data
rust/target
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/.env
*.zip
palette-preview*.html
skills-lock.json
